Package: holder-desktop
Architecture: any
Depends: holder-daemon (>= 0.1.7), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: GTK desktop frontend for Holder
 Holder Desktop is the GTK frontend for the Holder local-first workspace.
 It connects to the local Holder daemon to manage projects, cards, search,
 resources, git sync, and AI workflows.
